{"id":"5479","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5479_main_altocumulus-stratiformus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该云为广大的薄云片（成层云种），合并的云素大致平行线排列（波状云类）。透过云层可轻易看到天空，可确定为透光云类。在一行行合并的云素之间的空隙还可看到蓝天（漏隙云类）。其颜色以白色为主，但在后部边缘附近呈浅灰色，这是由于云较厚以及太阳的角度低。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛，圣布雷拉德，拉普隆特","latitude":"纬度: 49° 11' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 13' 33'' W","date":"25 November 2012 1626 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5479_syn_altocumulus-stratiformus-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>994 hPa低压的中心在爱尔兰。暖锋向东北方向移动，越过英吉利海峡东部，而冷锋则东移越过英吉利海峡西部。照片拍摄于弱暖区内，云在这个区域完全破碎，显现出高积云层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4709_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这层薄薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>覆盖了大面积的天空，是层状云种。它足够薄，能够显示太阳的位置（透光云云类）和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云元素之间的间隙</span>可以看到天空（漏隙云云类）。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细长元素</span>的存在几乎彼此平行，显示出多种类型的波纹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tze Ching Ho","location":"中国香港九龙城","latitude":"纬度: 22° 19' 51'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 11' 28'' E","date":"28 February 2016 0705 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4735_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这层高积云（云种为成层状）显然是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">半透明的（透明云类）</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">各元素之间的间隙可以看到天空（漏光云类）(2)</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细长的元素几乎彼此平行，表示其为波纹云类(4)</span>。这层云正在覆盖天空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Albert Reynolds","location":"南非罗伯逊","latitude":"纬度: 33° 47' 44'' S","longitude":"经度: 19° 52' 2'' E","date":"22 May 2014 1412 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4764_main_atlocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-at-night-with-a-lunar-corona_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在这个夜间图像中，薄薄一层的中层云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">透光层状高积云</span>，透过这层云可以看到月亮。在左边缘，云元素之间存在间隙，这也使得它们成为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙云</span>云类。月球周围的光学现象是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">月华的光环</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sigbjørn Underbakke","location":"挪威","latitude":"纬度: 59° 29' 31'' N","longitude":"经度: 6° 30' 57'' E","date":"27 September 2015 2247 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.2.2 17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.2.2 17"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5172_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这层中云是高积云。其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形云团和卷轴</span>视宽为1°-5°，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>。该高积云的具体云种可列为层状云，因为云的天空覆盖范围大。云片很透光，可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，因此它也是透光云类。在某些地方，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素之间有空隙</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长且大致平行的卷轴</span>表明也适用波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 36'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 49' 26'' W","date":"31 August 2014 0850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5193_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-perlucidus-from-the-air_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>图为在意大利阿尔卑斯山上空约11000米高空的飞机上看到的一层<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙波状成层高积云</span>。在图片右下方，可看到山脉上空有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"意大利，特伦托省","latitude":"纬度: 45° 45' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 10° 52' 13'' E","date":"02 September 2013 1749 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5792_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-perlucidus-and-translucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>强烈冬季季风盘踞在华南沿海上空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Miran Mng","location":"中国，香港，沙田","latitude":"纬度: 22° 22' 38'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 11' 51'' E","date":"17 December 2014 1715 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1 10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.1 10"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4536_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>一张由浅白色到深灰色的云片组成的图样，展示了高积云的主要特征：有规律排列的云层，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>处合并，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处分离，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处呈现破碎状。该云层属于透光变种，因为人们可以设想，通过大部分云体能够确定太阳的位置。云层并未逐渐侵占天空，因此编码为C<sub>M</sub> = 3，而非C<sub>M</sub> = 5。当时有一个天气扰动中心位于爱尔兰附近，观测站距离其暖锋前方约300公里，该暖锋正在经历快速的锋消过程。</p></div>","copyright":"© L. Buffault","location":"Jard-sur-Mer, France","latitude":"纬度: 46° 24' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 34' 38'' W","date":"08 August 1950 1910 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}